				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・c12ジムバッジ入手後
・表示後、トレーナー戦闘に</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</CommentCell>
